    {
      "id":"g7u-c2-addition","subject":"数学","grade":7,"semester":"上册","textbookVersion":"北师大版","chapterId":"g7u-chapter-2","title":"有理数的加减运算","lessonId":"g7-upper-integers","learningMode":"explanation","capabilityTags":["加减法则","运算律","实际应用"],
      "learningGuide":{"steps":["同号相加：保留共同符号，再把绝对值相加。例如 −3 + (−5) = −8。","异号相加：绝对值不相等时，用较大绝对值减较小绝对值，结果取绝对值较大者的符号；绝对值相等时，两数互为相反数，和为 0。","减去一个数，等于加上它的相反数：4 − (−2) = 4 + 2 = 6。","多个数相加可以交换、结合，把相反数或容易凑整的数放在一起。实际问题先约定正负意义再列式。"],"pitfalls":["减去负数要变为加正数，不是把两个负号保留下来。","交换项时必须连同符号一起移动。","温度变化量与最终温度不同：末温 = 初温 + 变化量。"]},
      "questions":[
        {"id":"g7u-c2-addition-d01","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c2-addition","capabilityTag":"加减法则","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"计算 −6 + (−4)。","options":[{"id":"a","text":"−10"},{"id":"b","text":"−2"},{"id":"c","text":"2"},{"id":"d","text":"10"}],"correctAnswer":"a","explanation":"同号两数相加，符号仍为负，绝对值 6 + 4 = 10，结果为 −10。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c2-addition-d02","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c2-addition","capabilityTag":"加减法则","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"计算 −9 + 14。","options":[{"id":"a","text":"−23"},{"id":"b","text":"−5"},{"id":"c","text":"5"},{"id":"d","text":"23"}],"correctAnswer":"c","explanation":"异号相加，14 − 9 = 5，较大绝对值对应正数，所以结果为 5。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c2-addition-d03","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c2-addition","capabilityTag":"加减法则","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"true-false","prompt":"7 − (−2) = 7 + 2。","options":[{"id":"true","text":"正确"},{"id":"false","text":"错误"}],"correctAnswer":"true","explanation":"减去 −2 等于加上 −2 的相反数 2。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c2-addition-d04","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c2-addition","capabilityTag":"加减法则","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"计算 −3 − 8。","options":[{"id":"a","text":"5"},{"id":"b","text":"11"},{"id":"c","text":"−5"},{"id":"d","text":"−11"}],"correctAnswer":"d","explanation":"−3 − 8 = −3 + (−8) = −11。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c2-addition-d05","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c2-addition","capabilityTag":"实际应用","difficulty":"advanced","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"早晨气温是 −4℃，中午升高了 9℃。中午气温是多少？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"−13℃"},{"id":"b","text":"5℃"},{"id":"c","text":"13℃"},{"id":"d","text":"−5℃"}],"correctAnswer":"b","explanation":"升高记为正变化，−4 + 9 = 5，所以中午为 5℃。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c2-addition-d06","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c2-addition","capabilityTag":"运算律","difficulty":"advanced","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"计算 −12 + 7 + 12 − 5。","options":[{"id":"a","text":"−2"},{"id":"b","text":"26"},{"id":"c","text":"2"},{"id":"d","text":"−22"}],"correctAnswer":"c","explanation":"先把 −12 与 12 相加得 0，剩下 7 − 5 = 2。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c2-addition-d07","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c2-addition","capabilityTag":"加减法则","difficulty":"advanced","responseType":"multi-choice","prompt":"下列等式中，哪些正确？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"−5 + 5 = 0"},{"id":"b","text":"3 − (−4) = −1"},{"id":"c","text":"−2 − 3 = −5"},{"id":"d","text":"0 − (−6) = 6"}],"correctAnswer":["a","c","d"],"explanation":"A 相反数相加得 0；C、D 符合减法法则；B 左边为 3 + 4 = 7，不是 −1。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c2-addition-d08","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c2-addition","capabilityTag":"加减法则","difficulty":"challenge","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"计算 −3/4 + 1/2 − (−1/4)。","options":[{"id":"a","text":"0"},{"id":"b","text":"−1/2"},{"id":"c","text":"1/2"},{"id":"d","text":"−1"}],"correctAnswer":"a","explanation":"统一为分母 4：−3/4 + 2/4 + 1/4 = 0。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c2-addition-d09","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c2-addition","capabilityTag":"运算律","difficulty":"challenge","responseType":"true-false","prompt":"对任意有理数 a、b，都有 a − b = b − a。","options":[{"id":"true","text":"正确"},{"id":"false","text":"错误"}],"correctAnswer":"false","explanation":"减法不满足交换律。例如 5 − 2 = 3，而 2 − 5 = −3。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c2-addition-d10","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c2-addition","capabilityTag":"实际应用","difficulty":"challenge","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"某账户原有 20 元，先支出 35 元，再收入 18 元。允许余额为负，最后余额是多少元？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"−33"},{"id":"b","text":"73"},{"id":"c","text":"−3"},{"id":"d","text":"3"}],"correctAnswer":"d","explanation":"按收入正、支出负列式：20 − 35 + 18 = −15 + 18 = 3。","source":"local-reviewed"}
