        {"id":"g7u-c2-multiplication-d01","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c2-multiplication","capabilityTag":"乘除法则","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"计算 (−6) × 4。","options":[{"id":"a","text":"24"},{"id":"b","text":"−24"},{"id":"c","text":"−10"},{"id":"d","text":"−2"}],"correctAnswer":"b","explanation":"异号相乘得负，6 × 4 = 24，所以积为 −24。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c2-multiplication-d02","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c2-multiplication","capabilityTag":"乘除法则","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"计算 (−35) ÷ (−7)。","options":[{"id":"a","text":"−5"},{"id":"b","text":"−28"},{"id":"c","text":"5"},{"id":"d","text":"28"}],"correctAnswer":"c","explanation":"同号相除得正，35 ÷ 7 = 5。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c2-multiplication-d03","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c2-multiplication","capabilityTag":"倒数","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"−2/3 的倒数是多少？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"−3/2"},{"id":"b","text":"3/2"},{"id":"c","text":"2/3"},{"id":"d","text":"−2/3"}],"correctAnswer":"a","explanation":"(−2/3) × (−3/2) = 1，因此倒数是 −3/2。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c2-multiplication-d04","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c2-multiplication","capabilityTag":"倒数","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"true-false","prompt":"0 的倒数是 0。","options":[{"id":"true","text":"正确"},{"id":"false","text":"错误"}],"correctAnswer":"false","explanation":"0 乘任何数都得 0，不可能得 1，所以 0 没有倒数。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c2-multiplication-d05","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c2-multiplication","capabilityTag":"乘除法则","difficulty":"advanced","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"计算 (−3/4) ÷ (3/2)。","options":[{"id":"a","text":"−9/8"},{"id":"b","text":"1/2"},{"id":"c","text":"−2"},{"id":"d","text":"−1/2"}],"correctAnswer":"d","explanation":"除以 3/2 变为乘 2/3，(−3/4) × (2/3) = −1/2。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c2-multiplication-d06","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c2-multiplication","capabilityTag":"乘除法则","difficulty":"advanced","responseType":"true-false","prompt":"三个负数相乘，积一定是负数。","options":[{"id":"true","text":"正确"},{"id":"false","text":"错误"}],"correctAnswer":"true","explanation":"负数均非零，负因数个数为奇数，所以积为负。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c2-multiplication-d07","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c2-multiplication","capabilityTag":"乘除法则","difficulty":"advanced","responseType":"multi-choice","prompt":"下列等式中，哪些正确？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"(−2) × (−5) = 10"},{"id":"b","text":"0 ÷ (−4) = 0"},{"id":"c","text":"8 ÷ 0 = 0"},{"id":"d","text":"(−12) ÷ 3 = −4"}],"correctAnswer":["a","b","d"],"explanation":"同号乘法得正，异号除法得负；0 可作被除数但不能作除数，因此 C 无意义。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c2-multiplication-d08","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c2-multiplication","capabilityTag":"运算律","difficulty":"challenge","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"计算 (−12) × (1/3 − 1/4)。","options":[{"id":"a","text":"1"},{"id":"b","text":"−1"},{"id":"c","text":"−7"},{"id":"d","text":"7"}],"correctAnswer":"b","explanation":"用分配律得 −4 + 3 = −1；也可先算括号内为 1/12。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c2-multiplication-d09","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c2-multiplication","capabilityTag":"乘除法则","difficulty":"challenge","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"计算 (−2) × (−3) × (−4) × (−5)。","options":[{"id":"a","text":"−120"},{"id":"b","text":"−14"},{"id":"c","text":"120"},{"id":"d","text":"14"}],"correctAnswer":"c","explanation":"四个负因数使积为正，2 × 3 × 4 × 5 = 120。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c2-multiplication-d10","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c2-multiplication","capabilityTag":"运算律","difficulty":"challenge","responseType":"multi-choice","prompt":"对任意有理数 a、b、c，下列恒等式中，哪些成立？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"a × b = b × a"},{"id":"b","text":"a × (b + c) = a × b + a × c"},{"id":"c","text":"a × (b + c) = a × b + c"},{"id":"d","text":"(a × b) × c = a × (b × c)"}],"correctAnswer":["a","b","d"],"explanation":"A、B、D 分别是乘法交换律、分配律、结合律；C 漏乘了 c 前的 a。","source":"local-reviewed"}
      ],
