      "id":"g7u-c2-powers","subject":"数学","grade":7,"semester":"上册","textbookVersion":"北师大版","chapterId":"g7u-chapter-2","title":"乘方、混合运算与科学记数法","lessonId":"g7-upper-integers","learningMode":"explanation","capabilityTags":["乘方意义","运算顺序","科学记数法"],
      "learningGuide":{"steps":["乘方表示相同因数连乘：3 的 4 次方是 3 × 3 × 3 × 3，而不是 3 × 4。","看清底数有没有负号：括号内的 −2 整体平方得到 4；−2² 表示 2 的平方的相反数，等于 −4。","混合运算先算括号，再算乘方，再乘除，最后加减；同级从左向右计算。","较大的正数可写成 a × 10ⁿ，其中 1 ≤ a < 10，n 为整数。例如 72000 = 7.2 × 10⁴；把小数点移了几位就核对指数。"],"pitfalls":["(−a)² 与 −a² 不相同，不能忽略括号。","负数的奇次幂为负，偶次幂为正。","科学记数法的首个因数必须至少为 1 且小于 10，72 × 10³ 虽等值却不是规范写法。"]},
      "questions":[
        {"id":"g7u-c2-powers-d01","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c2-powers","capabilityTag":"乘方意义","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"计算 (−3)²。","options":[{"id":"a","text":"−9"},{"id":"b","text":"6"},{"id":"c","text":"9"},{"id":"d","text":"−6"}],"correctAnswer":"c","explanation":"底数为 −3，(−3) × (−3) = 9。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c2-powers-d02","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c2-powers","capabilityTag":"乘方意义","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"计算 −3²（负号在平方运算之外）。","options":[{"id":"a","text":"−9"},{"id":"b","text":"9"},{"id":"c","text":"−6"},{"id":"d","text":"6"}],"correctAnswer":"a","explanation":"先算 3² = 9，再取相反数，得到 −9。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c2-powers-d03","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c2-powers","capabilityTag":"乘方意义","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"true-false","prompt":"2⁴ 表示四个 2 连乘，而不是 2 乘 4。","options":[{"id":"true","text":"正确"},{"id":"false","text":"错误"}],"correctAnswer":"true","explanation":"2⁴ = 2 × 2 × 2 × 2 = 16，而 2 × 4 = 8。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c2-powers-d04","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c2-powers","capabilityTag":"运算顺序","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"计算 5 + 2 × 3。","options":[{"id":"a","text":"21"},{"id":"b","text":"16"},{"id":"c","text":"10"},{"id":"d","text":"11"}],"correctAnswer":"d","explanation":"先乘后加，2 × 3 = 6，5 + 6 = 11。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c2-powers-d05","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c2-powers","capabilityTag":"运算顺序","difficulty":"advanced","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"计算 18 ÷ (−3)²。","options":[{"id":"a","text":"−2"},{"id":"b","text":"2"},{"id":"c","text":"36"},{"id":"d","text":"−6"}],"correctAnswer":"b","explanation":"先乘方得 (−3)² = 9，再算 18 ÷ 9 = 2。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c2-powers-d06","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c2-powers","capabilityTag":"科学记数法","difficulty":"advanced","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"72000 用规范的科学记数法表示是哪一个？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"72 × 10³"},{"id":"b","text":"0.72 × 10⁵"},{"id":"c","text":"7.2 × 10⁴"},{"id":"d","text":"7.2 × 10³"}],"correctAnswer":"c","explanation":"72000 = 7.2 × 10000 = 7.2 × 10⁴，且 1 ≤ 7.2 < 10。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c2-powers-d07","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c2-powers","capabilityTag":"乘方意义","difficulty":"advanced","responseType":"multi-choice","prompt":"下列等式中，哪些正确？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"(−2)³ = −8"},{"id":"b","text":"(−2)⁴ = 16"},{"id":"c","text":"−2⁴ = 16"},{"id":"d","text":"0³ = 0"}],"correctAnswer":["a","b","d"],"explanation":"负数奇次幂为负、偶次幂为正；C 的负号在乘方外，应为 −16；0 的正整数次幂为 0。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c2-powers-d08","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c2-powers","capabilityTag":"运算顺序","difficulty":"challenge","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"计算 −2² + 3 × (−4 + 6)。","options":[{"id":"a","text":"2"},{"id":"b","text":"10"},{"id":"c","text":"−10"},{"id":"d","text":"−2"}],"correctAnswer":"a","explanation":"−2² = −4，括号内为 2，所以原式 = −4 + 3 × 2 = 2。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c2-powers-d09","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c2-powers","capabilityTag":"运算顺序","difficulty":"challenge","responseType":"true-false","prompt":"计算 24 ÷ 6 × 2 时，应先算 6 × 2，所以结果是 2。","options":[{"id":"true","text":"正确"},{"id":"false","text":"错误"}],"correctAnswer":"false","explanation":"乘除同级，必须从左向右：24 ÷ 6 × 2 = 4 × 2 = 8。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c2-powers-d10","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c2-powers","capabilityTag":"科学记数法","difficulty":"challenge","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"一个图书馆有 3.6 × 10⁴ 本书，新增 4000 本后共有多少本？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"7600"},{"id":"b","text":"364000"},{"id":"c","text":"3604000"},{"id":"d","text":"40000"}],"correctAnswer":"d","explanation":"3.6 × 10⁴ = 36000，36000 + 4000 = 40000。","source":"local-reviewed"}
