        {"id":"g7u-c2-powers-r10","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c2-powers","capabilityTag":"科学记数法","difficulty":"challenge","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"某场馆一年接待 2.4 × 10⁵ 人，下一年减少 40000 人。下一年接待多少人？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"200000"},{"id":"b","text":"280000"},{"id":"c","text":"20000"},{"id":"d","text":"236000"}],"correctAnswer":"a","explanation":"2.4 × 10⁵ = 240000，240000 − 40000 = 200000。","source":"local-reviewed"}
